flowchart LR
    R[Conversation 从非 Resolved 变为 Resolved] --> E{FAQ Learning 开启?}
    E -- 否 --> STOP[结束]
    E -- 是 --> Q[内存 Mining Queue]
    Q --> H[最多读取 40 条公开消息]
    H --> F[过滤 AI 回复，只保留客户与人工答案]
    F --> L[CompletionRaw 提取 JSON FAQ]
    L --> D[Embedding 相似度 + Pending Question 去重]
    D --> P[(pending suggestion)]
    P --> A{管理员审核}
    A -- Reject --> X[rejected]
    A -- Approve/Edit --> K[创建 enabled Snippet]
    K --> OK[approved]
